    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "图文页：`python -m pipeline.pages <表.json> plan` 排出每页起止并做文字时序检查，`stills [秒数]` 出关键帧。分镜路线：保存片段后运行 `run.ps1 build`、`lint`、`preview`。独立网页作品：`webfilm/run.ps1 preview <作品目录>` 打开实时播放器，`stills --at …` 出关键帧，`render --start … --end …` 只出一段。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **先排时间、查硬错误**　检查页次、重点词、时长、文字时序和确定会越界的文字；硬错误先修。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
